# Variadic function called with zero extra args: xs collects into an empty Dict({}).
# This is the zero-variadic-args case: no positional args are supplied.
# Unannotated rest collects into a Dict (integer-keyed). Empty = Dict({}).
[f: [fn [let ...xs] xs]
 result: [f]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(xs), "result": Dict({})})
